ōketopa  NTag ; ! "October" (loan)
noema    NTag ; ! "November" (loan)
tīhema   NTag ; ! "December" (loan)
rāhina   NTag ; ! "Monday"
rātū     NTag ; ! "Tuesday"
rāapa    NTag ; ! "Wednesday"
rāpare   NTag ; ! "Thursday"
rāmere   NTag ; ! "Friday"
